      <h3>Tri-Wavelength LED</h3>
      <p>Targeted red, blue, and amber spectrums to address acne, aging, and inflammation simultaneously.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="advantage-item">
      <div class="advantage-icon">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"></polyline></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Dermatologist Tested</h3>
      <p>FDA-cleared technology verified by clinical trials for 45% improvement in skin elasticity.</p>
